  dialogueBox: {fileID: 1403475073}
  dialogueChangeEvent: 1
  linesBefore:
  - "Light Bringer, please\u2026 Light the path on your way as you go."
  - Legends foretell of the light you shall spread through the mythical [X] button.
  - 'Your own exclusive button, though very similar to the [Z] button we use to go
    forward through doors or the [C] button to go back the other way. '
  linesAfter:
  - Oh! You found a key, excellent!
  - "I don\u2019t need it but perhaps there\u2019s someone else in dire need of one!"
